  "changed_factors": [
    "Introduce Exponential Moving Prototype Flow (critic_formulation=empf, prior_regularizer=empf, name=empf) inspired by e-means (Bessa et al., arXiv:2611.09501): replace raw-minibatch transport targets and SBNP prior regularization with an online sufficient-statistics prototype bank (S, N) using clock-free (K, B) hit-rate EMA scaling, deterministic mass-conserving proportional-split dead-prototype revival, mass-weighted prototype-to-fake entropic Optimal Transport chords (with automatic fiber-aligned bypass on conditioned critics), Elastic Born-Infeld gradient bounding plus zero-mean logit gauge, instance-bound state-driven thermal cooling, and degree-of-freedom-aware EMPF prior regularization with local scatter circularization and outlier revival tether. All DualNorm, quintic convolution, batched SVD, BF16 channels-last conv training, learning rate, prior_lr_mult (2.5), prior_reg (0.01), smoothing, architecture, initialization, and sampling settings match bispf-throughput-v1 / presets[bispf_optimized]."
